<import src="../../ratings/framework7-recovery-common.wxml" />
<view class="screen management-page target-owner-edit f7-ios-theme f7-rating-recovery">
  <wu-f7-block class="f7-recovery-content" spacing="compact">
  <view class="management-context">
    <view class="management-context-icon">
      <wu-icon name="edit" tone="accent" size="22" />
    </view>
    <view class="management-context-copy">
      <view class="context-title">
        {{name || '编辑评分对象'}}
      </view>
      <view class="meta">
        名称与说明
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <template is="rating-status" data="{{status,error,receiptStatus,hasSession,frozen,recoveryOperation,busy,needsRefresh}}" />
  <view class="notice">
    仅可编辑当前获准访问的通用评分对象名称与说明。地区和分类保持原值。服务器会重新核验创建者资格、当前版本与精确内容审核；图片与审核签发尚未开放。
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{ready}}" class="card">
    <view class="section-title">
      名称（最多 100 字）
    </view>
    <wu-f7-input value="{{name}}" bind:input="onName" maxlength="-1" disabled="{{busy || frozen || editConfirmation}}" placeholder="填写具体对象名称"  />
    <view class="section-title">
      说明（最多 500 字）
    </view>
    <textarea value="{{description}}" bindinput="onDescription" maxlength="-1" disabled="{{busy || frozen || editConfirmation}}" placeholder="可选，介绍这个评分对象" />
    <wu-f7-button bind:press="onEdit" disabled="{{busy || frozen || !name || editConfirmation}}" class="management-primary" variant="fill" size="large">
      确认这些修改
    </wu-f7-button>
    <view wx:if="{{editConfirmation}}" class="management-confirmation" aria-role="alert">
      <view class="notice">
        确认提交当前名称和说明？已有评分和互动历史会保留。提交后原输入与编号被冻结，结果未知时只能恢复同一请求或明确撤销。
      </view>
      <wu-f7-button bind:press="onConfirmEdit" disabled="{{busy || frozen}}" class="management-primary" variant="fill" size="large">
        确认提交编辑申请
      </wu-f7-button>
      <wu-f7-button bind:press="onDismissEdit" class="management-quiet" variant="plain">
        返回修改
      </wu-f7-button>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{canCancelEditing}}" class="card">
    <wu-f7-button bind:press="onCancelEditing" disabled="{{busy}}" class="management-action" variant="tonal">
      撤销这次未确认的编辑申请
    </wu-f7-button>
    <view wx:if="{{cancelEditingConfirmation}}" class="management-confirmation" aria-role="alert">
      <view class="notice">
        确认撤销原编辑申请？服务器将关闭尚未完成的原请求；若编辑已经成功，只会返回成功回执，不会回退已发布的修改。
      </view>
      <wu-f7-button bind:press="onConfirmCancelEditing" disabled="{{busy}}" class="management-destructive" variant="tonal" tone="danger">
        确认撤销原申请
      </wu-f7-button>
      <wu-f7-button bind:press="onDismissCancelEditing" disabled="{{busy}}" class="management-action" variant="plain">
        保留原申请
      </wu-f7-button>
    </view>
  </view>
  <wu-f7-button bind:press="onCancel" class="management-quiet" variant="plain">
    关闭确认并停止等待
  </wu-f7-button>
  <wu-f7-button bind:press="onReturnCatalog" class="management-quiet" variant="plain">
    返回目录并重新加载
  </wu-f7-button>
  </wu-f7-block>
</view>
